    <string name="device_admin_policy">Device Admin Policy</string>
    <string name="device_admin_policy_description">Device admin policy allows enhanced device management features for better control over your device settings and restrictions. This feature is optional and can be disabled at any time.</string>
    <string name="device_admin_policy_explanation">ScreenTime uses device admin to provide focus mode features like locking your screen and temporarily disabling the camera during focus sessions. This helps you stay focused and reduce distractions. You can disable this feature at any time from Settings.</string>
    <string name="device_admin_policy_info">Device admin policy provides focus mode features like screen lock and camera control. This is completely optional and you can disable it at any time from this screen or from Android Settings > Security > Device Admin Apps. ScreenTime will never prevent you from uninstalling the app or disabling device admin.</string>
